  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Towards climate resilient Water, Sanitation &amp; Hygiene services in Chukha District in Bhutan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment will accelerate progress in rural water, sanitation and hygiene services and improve water security in Chukha District in Bhutan. It will complement similar activities being implemented in three districts under the Water for Women project. Gender equality and social inclusion will be an integral part of the investment. This investment will provide additional insights to inform Bhutan&apos;s national approach on management models for rural water supply services and build upon previous work in sanitation and hygiene.</narrative>
  </description>
